ascension-path-given = Heaven is watching this station. You hold a Fork in the Road: use it in hand to choose the path of qi or the path of the body. The first to reach the peak rules over everyone.
ascension-path-qi-tip = The Path of Qi: draw heaven and earth's energy into your dantian, master an element, and fly, strike and heal with techniques. Faster to start, frailer in the body. Choose an element next.
ascension-path-body-tip = The Path of the Body: temper flesh and bone through nine stages until nothing can hurt you. Slower and harder, but far tougher and deadlier up close. You can never cultivate qi.
ascension-path-metal-tip = Metal, the Golden Edge Sutra: flying swords and sword rain. Sharp, precise, deadly at range.
ascension-path-wood-tip = Wood, the Evergreen Spring Canon: healing springs and binding vines. Outlasts everyone.
ascension-path-water-tip = Water, the Still Lake Scripture: still water and tidal surges. Calm, slippery, hard to pin down.
ascension-path-fire-tip = Fire, the Scorching Sun Classic: burning palms and seas of flame. The fiercest attacker.
ascension-path-earth-tip = Earth, the Immovable Mountain Record: rooted stances and crushing stone. The hardest to move or kill.
ascension-chose-qi = The road of qi opens before you. Read {THE($book)} (use it in hand) to awaken and learn its law.
ascension-chose-body = The road of the body opens before you. Read {THE($book)} (use it in hand) to commit your flesh to the path.
ascension-peak-announcement = Heaven trembles: {$winner} has reached the peak of cultivation and stands above everyone aboard as the Supreme Sovereign. Pray they are merciful.
ascension-peak-self = You stand at the peak of cultivation, the Supreme Sovereign of this station. Blows land on you at three-quarter strength. Settle every score before the shuttle comes.
ascension-round-end-winner = {$winner} reached the peak of cultivation first and was proclaimed Supreme Sovereign.
ascension-round-end-none = Nobody reached the peak of cultivation.
